          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Project Outline\n## Fonts Used\nThe framework uses the Lato font family from the assets/fonts folder in the following weights:\n\n- 300 (Light)\n- 400 (Regular)\n- 700 (Bold)\n\nCSS file location to update fonts: `source/scss/partials/_fonts.scss`\n\n## Colors Used\nThe framework defines a comprehensive color system including:\n\n- Primary colors (brand identity)\n- Action colors (CTAs, buttons, interactions)\n- Semantic colors (success, warning, error, info)\n- Text role colors\n- Neutral UI colors\n- Support/utility colors\n- Admin button colors\n- Social media colors\n\nCSS file location to update colors: `source/scss/partials/_variables.scss`\n\n## Source SCSS Folder Structure\n- dd-framework.scss: Main framework entry point\n- style.scss: Primary stylesheet entry point\n- vendors/: Styles for third-party libraries (e.g., SAL)\n- components/: SCSS files for reusable UI components (e.g., accordions, banners, cards)\n- drupal-components/: Styles specific to Drupal CMS components\n- elements/: Base styles for HTML elements (forms, tables, text, etc.)\n- fonts/: Local fonts\n- layouts/: Page-specific layout styles\n- partials/: Utility files including variables, mixins, fonts, grid system, and custom animations\n- regions/: Styles for page regions (header, footer, sidebar)\n\n## Source JS Folder Structure\n- main.js: Main JavaScript entry point\n- components/: JavaScript files for interactive components (e.g., navigation, sliders, tabs)\n- vendors/: Third-party JavaScript libraries (e.g., SAL)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-accordion",
      "slug": "components/accordion",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Accordion Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Accordion Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-accordion component provides a collapsible content structure.",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-accordion-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-accordion-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Accordion Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-accordion component provides a collapsible content structure.\nIt leverages native HTML5 *details* and\n*summary* elements for accessibility and progressive\nenhancement, ensuring it works without JavaScript in modern browsers\nwhile allowing for JS enhancements.\n\nThis component is ideal for FAQs, expandable sections, or grouped\ncontent. In WordPress, configure it via ACF repeater fields for\naccordion items (e.g., title and body). In Drupal, use a Paragraph\ntype with fields for header and copy, rendered as a list of items.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nWrap accordion items in a container with class *dd-accordion*.\nEach item uses *details* with a shared *name* attribute\n(e.g., \"group1\") to enforce exclusive opening (only one open at a\ntime). The *summary* acts as the toggle, and the content\nfollows in *div* with a class of\n*class=\"dd-accordion__copy*.\n\nAdd spacers (e.g., *div class=\"dd-spacer -xl\"*) between items\nfor visual separation if needed."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<div class=\"dd-accordion\">\n    <div class=\"dd-accordion__items\">\n        <details name=\"group1\" class=\"dd-accordion__item\">\n            <summary class=\"dd-accordion__header dd-g -y-center\">\n                <div class=\"dd-accordion__title dd-u-1-1\">\n                    Header Name\n                </div>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"dd-accordion__copy\">\n                <p>\n                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </details>\n        <details name=\"group1\" class=\"dd-accordion__item\">\n            <summary class=\"dd-accordion__header dd-g -y-center\">\n                <div class=\"dd-accordion__title dd-u-1-1\">\n                    Header Name\n                </div>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"dd-accordion__copy\">\n                <p>\n                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </details>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<div class=\"dd-accordion\">\n    <div class=\"dd-accordion__items\">\n        <details name=\"group1\" class=\"dd-accordion__item\">\n            <summary class=\"dd-accordion__header dd-g -y-center\">\n                <div class=\"dd-accordion__title dd-u-1-1\">\n                    Header Name\n                </div>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"dd-accordion__copy\">\n                <p>\n                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </details>\n        <details name=\"group1\" class=\"dd-accordion__item\">\n            <summary class=\"dd-accordion__header dd-g -y-center\">\n                <div class=\"dd-accordion__title dd-u-1-1\">\n                    Header Name\n                </div>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"dd-accordion__copy\">\n                <p>\n                    Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </details>\n    </div>\n</div>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_accordion.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines base styles for the accordion, including\ntransitions, icons (e.g., chevrons via pseudo-elements), and\nhover/focus states. Key modifiers include:\n\n- *[open]*: Applied to the *details* element when\n  expanded (via attribute selector [open]). Rotates icons and adjusts\n  borders or backgrounds for visual feedback.\n- *-primary*: Sets the hover and open states to the primary\n  action colors.\n- *-secondary*: Sets the hover and open states to the secondary\n  action colors.\n- *-tertiary*: Sets the hover and open states to the tertiary\n  action colors.\n- *-borderless*: Eliminates borders around items for a cleaner\n  look.\n- *-compact*: Reduces padding and font sizes for denser\n  layouts, useful in sidebars or mobile views.\n- Utility classes for alignment.  *-x-center -y-center*\n- SAL data attributes for custom animations.\n  *data-sal=\"slide-up\"*\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/js/vendors/sal.js (animations)\n- source/scss/components/_dd_accordion.scss (styles)\n\nFor ACF/Paragraphs integration, map fields to generate dynamic item\nIDs for JS targeting.\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nEnsure headers are focusable and keyboard-navigable. Use semantic\nheadings in titles if appropriate. Test with screen readers. In CMS,\nmake fields required for titles to avoid empty summaries."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-alert",
      "slug": "components/alert",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Alert Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Alert Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-alert component provides a flexible way to display notification messages, such as warnings, errors, successes, or informational alerts.",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-alert-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-alert-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Alert Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-alert component provides a flexible way to display notification\nmessages, such as warnings, errors, successes, or informational\nalerts. It supports different severity levels with color-coded visuals\nfor quick user recognition.\n\nThis component is ideal for form validation feedback, system messages,\nor user notifications. In WordPress, configure it via ACF fields for\nalert type, heading, and text. In Drupal, use a Paragraph type with\nselect fields for type and text areas for content, allowing dynamic\nrendering based on conditions.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nWrap the alert content in a container with class *dd-alert* and\n*role=\"alert\"* for accessibility. Include a heading and text,\nwith optional links. Use SAL for fade-in animations."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<div class=\"dd-alert\" role=\"alert\" data-sal=\"fade\">\n  <div class=\"dd-alert__content dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"l-box\">\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__heading\">\n          Default Alert\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__copy\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <a href=\"#\">link</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<div class=\"dd-alert -info\" role=\"alert\" data-sal=\"fade\">\n  <div class=\"dd-alert__content dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"l-box\">\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__heading\">\n          Info Alert\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__copy\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <a href=\"#\">link</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<div class=\"dd-alert -success\" role=\"alert\" data-sal=\"fade\">\n  <div class=\"dd-alert__content dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"l-box\">\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__heading\">\n          Success Alert\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__copy\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <a href=\"#\">link</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<div class=\"dd-alert -warning\" role=\"alert\" data-sal=\"fade\">\n  <div class=\"dd-alert__content dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"l-box\">\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__heading\">\n          Warning Alert\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__copy\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <a href=\"#\">link</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<div class=\"dd-alert -error\" role=\"alert\" data-sal=\"fade\">\n  <div class=\"dd-alert__content dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"l-box\">\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__heading\">\n          Error Alert\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__copy\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <a href=\"#\">link</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<div class=\"dd-alert\" role=\"alert\" data-sal=\"fade\">\n  <div class=\"dd-alert__content dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"l-box\">\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__heading\">\n          Default Alert\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__copy\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <a href=\"#\">link</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"dd-alert -info\" role=\"alert\" data-sal=\"fade\">\n  <div class=\"dd-alert__content dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"l-box\">\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__heading\">\n          Info Alert\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__copy\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <a href=\"#\">link</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"dd-alert -success\" role=\"alert\" data-sal=\"fade\">\n  <div class=\"dd-alert__content dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"l-box\">\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__heading\">\n          Success Alert\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__copy\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <a href=\"#\">link</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"dd-alert -warning\" role=\"alert\" data-sal=\"fade\">\n  <div class=\"dd-alert__content dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"l-box\">\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__heading\">\n          Warning Alert\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__copy\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <a href=\"#\">link</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"dd-alert -error\" role=\"alert\" data-sal=\"fade\">\n  <div class=\"dd-alert__content dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"l-box\">\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__heading\">\n          Error Alert\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__copy\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <a href=\"#\">link</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "Add spacers between multiple alerts for separation.\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_alert.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines base styles for alerts, including colors,\nborders, and icons based on type. Key modifiers include:\n\n- *-info*: Blue-themed for informational messages.\n- *-success*: Green-themed for positive confirmations.\n- *-warning*: Yellow/orange-themed for cautions.\n- *-error*: Red-themed for errors or critical alerts.\n- *-compact*: Reduces padding for inline or space-constrained\n  uses.\n- Utility classes for alignment.  *-x-center -y-center*\n- SAL data attributes for custom animations.\n  *data-sal=\"slide-up\"*\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/js/vendors/sal.js (animations)\n- source/scss/components/_dd_alert.scss (styles)\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nUse role=\"alert\" for immediate announcements. Ensure color contrast\nmeets WCAG standards. Include icons for visual cues but hide them from\nscreen readers if decorative. Test with screen readers for live\nupdates. In CMS, make text fields support HTML for links, and validate\nfor empty content."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-alternating",
      "slug": "components/alternating",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Alternating Content Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Alternating Content Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-alternating component provides a layout for alternating content blocks, typically featuring an image on one side and text on the other, which...",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-alternating-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-alternating-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Alternating Content Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-alternating component provides a layout for alternating content\nblocks, typically featuring an image on one side and text on the\nother, which switches sides for each subsequent item. This creates a\nvisually engaging zigzag pattern, ideal for showcasing features,\nbenefits, or narrative sections.\n\nThis component is great for pages like \"About Us,\" product features,\nor case studies. In WordPress, configure it via ACF repeater fields\nfor alternating items (e.g., image, title, body, links). In Drupal,\nuse a Paragraph type with fields for image and copy, rendered in a\nloop with alternating logic.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nWrap items in a container with class *dd-alternating* and\n*role=\"region\"* for accessibility. Each item contains a grid\nwith image and copy columns that stack on mobile and side-by-side on\nlarger screens. Use SAL attributes for fade animations."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<div class=\"dd-alternating\" role=\"region\">\n  <div class=\"dd-alternating__items dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-alternating__item dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"dd-alternating__content dd-g\">\n        <div\n          class=\"dd-alternating__image dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\"\n          data-sal=\"slide-up\"\n        >\n          <img\n            src=\"https://dummyimage.com/600x400/000/fff\"\n            class=\"dd-img\"\n            alt=\"\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div\n          class=\"dd-alternating__copy l-box dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\"\n          data-sal=\"slide-up\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"dd-alternating__title\">\n            <h2>Alternating title</h2>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-alternating__body\">\n            <p>Alternating body copy</p>\n            <div class=\"dd-alternating__links\">\n              <div class=\"dd-alternating__link\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">Alternating Link 1</a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"dd-alternating__link\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -ghost\">Alternating Link 2</a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dd-alternating__item dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"dd-alternating__content dd-g\">\n        <div\n          class=\"dd-alternating__image dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\"\n          data-sal=\"slide-up\"\n        >\n          <img\n            src=\"https://dummyimage.com/600x400/000/fff\"\n            class=\"dd-img\"\n            alt=\"\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div\n          class=\"dd-alternating__copy l-box dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\"\n          data-sal=\"slide-up\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"dd-alternating__title\">\n            <h2>Alternating title</h2>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-alternating__body\">\n            <p>Alternating body copy</p>\n            <div class=\"dd-alternating__links\">\n              <div class=\"dd-alternating__link\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">Alternating Link 1</a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"dd-alternating__link\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -ghost\">Alternating Link 2</a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<div class=\"dd-alternating\" role=\"region\">\n  <div class=\"dd-alternating__items dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-alternating__item dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"dd-alternating__content dd-g\">\n        <div\n          class=\"dd-alternating__image dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\"\n          data-sal=\"slide-up\"\n        >\n          <img\n            src=\"https://dummyimage.com/600x400/000/fff\"\n            class=\"dd-img\"\n            alt=\"\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div\n          class=\"dd-alternating__copy l-box dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\"\n          data-sal=\"slide-up\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"dd-alternating__title\">\n            <h2>Alternating title</h2>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-alternating__body\">\n            <p>Alternating body copy</p>\n            <div class=\"dd-alternating__links\">\n              <div class=\"dd-alternating__link\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">Alternating Link 1</a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"dd-alternating__link\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -ghost\">Alternating Link 2</a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dd-alternating__item dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"dd-alternating__content dd-g\">\n        <div\n          class=\"dd-alternating__image dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\"\n          data-sal=\"slide-up\"\n        >\n          <img\n            src=\"https://dummyimage.com/600x400/000/fff\"\n            class=\"dd-img\"\n            alt=\"\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div\n          class=\"dd-alternating__copy l-box dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\"\n          data-sal=\"slide-up\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"dd-alternating__title\">\n            <h2>Alternating title</h2>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-alternating__body\">\n            <p>Alternating body copy</p>\n            <div class=\"dd-alternating__links\">\n              <div class=\"dd-alternating__link\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">Alternating Link 1</a>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"dd-alternating__link\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -ghost\">Alternating Link 2</a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "The framework uses CSS *:nth-child(odd/even)* to alternate\nimage/copy positions automatically.\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_alternating.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines base styles for the alternating layout,\nincluding responsive grid, spacing, and integration with SAL for\nanimations. Key modifiers include:\n\n- *-reverse*: Reverses the default alternating direction (e.g.,\n  starts with copy on left).\n- *-no-alternate*: Disables alternating, keeping all items in\n  the same order (image left, copy right).\n- Utility classes for alignment.  *-x-center -y-center*\n- SAL data attributes for custom animations.\n  *data-sal=\"slide-up\"*\n\nFor ACF/Paragraphs integration, use repeater sub-fields to generate\nitems dynamically, with optional fields for custom modifiers.\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/js/vendors/sal.js (animations)\n- source/scss/components/_dd_alternating.scss (styles)\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nUse descriptive alt text for images. Ensure copy uses semantic\nheadings. The *role=\"region\"* helps screen readers identify the\nsection. Test keyboard navigation and color contrast. In CMS, validate\nimage uploads for alt text requirements."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-badge",
      "slug": "components/badge",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Badge Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Badge Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-badge component is a compact, non-interactive pill used to communicate a status or severity level at a glance, such as critical, warning, info, or pass.",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-badge-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-badge-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Badge Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-badge component is a compact, non-interactive pill used to\ncommunicate a status or severity level at a glance, such as critical,\nwarning, info, or pass. Its colour-coded surface pairs with a short\ntext label for fast, scannable recognition.\n\nThis component is ideal for audit summaries, dashboards, and inline\nstatus indicators next to titles or table cells. In WordPress,\nconfigure it via ACF fields for severity and label. In Drupal, use a\nParagraph type with a select field for severity and a text field for\nthe label, allowing dynamic rendering based on data.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nWrap the badge in a container with class *dd-badge* and place\nthe visible text inside a *dd-badge__label* element. Apply a\nseverity modifier such as *-critical* or omit it for the\nneutral variant. An optional *dd-badge__icon* may precede the\nlabel."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<span class=\"dd-badge -critical\"><span class=\"dd-badge__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔴</span><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"dd-badge -warning\"><span class=\"dd-badge__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚠️</span><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Warning</span></span>\n<span class=\"dd-badge -info\"><span class=\"dd-badge__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ℹ️</span><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Info</span></span>\n<span class=\"dd-badge -pass\"><span class=\"dd-badge__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✅</span><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"dd-badge\"><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">14 tasks</span></span>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<span class=\"dd-badge -critical\"><span class=\"dd-badge__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔴</span><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"dd-badge -warning\"><span class=\"dd-badge__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚠️</span><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Warning</span></span>\n<span class=\"dd-badge -info\"><span class=\"dd-badge__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ℹ️</span><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Info</span></span>\n<span class=\"dd-badge -pass\"><span class=\"dd-badge__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✅</span><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"dd-badge\"><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">14 tasks</span></span>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "Use spacers or inline gaps when placing multiple badges in a row.\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_badge.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines the base pill shape, padding, and typography,\nwith severity modifiers mapping to design tokens. Key modifiers\ninclude:\n\n- *-critical*: Error tokens for the most severe status.\n- *-warning*: Warning tokens for cautionary status.\n- *-info*: Info tokens for neutral informational status.\n- *-pass*: Success tokens for passing or healthy status.\n- No modifier: Neutral variant using default surface tokens for\n  unclassified status.\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/scss/components/_dd_badge.scss (styles)\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nMeaning is carried by the *dd-badge__label* text, never by\ncolour alone (WCAG 1.4.1 Use of Colour), so a badge remains\nunderstandable in greyscale or to colour-blind users. The optional\n*dd-badge__icon* is decorative and marked\n*aria-hidden=\"true\"*. The badge is non-interactive, so it takes\nno role, tabindex, or focus. Keep labels short and unambiguous, and\nensure the surface and text colours meet WCAG AA contrast."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-banner",
      "slug": "components/banner",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Banner Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Banner Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-banner component provides a full-width banner image with customizable background positioning.",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-banner-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-banner-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Banner Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-banner component provides a full-width banner image with\ncustomizable background positioning. It's designed for hero sections,\npromotional banners, or visual breaks, supporting responsive images\nand inline styles for background.\n\nThis component is ideal for landing pages or section dividers. In\nWordPress, configure it via ACF fields for image upload, alt text, and\nposition modifier. In Drupal, use a Paragraph type with image field\nand select list for background position, rendering the style attribute\ndynamically.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nUse a div with class *dd-banner* and data-sal for animations.\nSet background-image via inline style, with an img element for\nforeground or fallback, using srcset for responsiveness."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<div class=\"dd-banner\" data-sal=\"fade\" style=\"background-image: url(https://dummyimage.com/1440x600/000/fff);\">\n  <div class=\"dd-banner__image\">\n  <img\n    sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw 1024px\"\n    srcset=\"\n      https://dummyimage.com/720x400/000/fff 720w\n      https://dummyimage.com/1440x600/000/fff 1024w\"\n    src=\"https://dummyimage.com/1440x600/000/fff\" class=\"dd-img\" alt=\"Banner image description\" />\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;div class=&quot;dd-banner&quot; data-sal=&quot;fade&quot; style=&quot;background-image: url(https://dummyimage.com/1440x600/000/fff);&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;dd-banner__image&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;img\n    sizes=&quot;(max-width: 1024px) 100vw 1024px&quot;\n    srcset=&quot;\n      https://dummyimage.com/720x400/000/fff 720w\n      https://dummyimage.com/1440x600/000/fff 1024w&quot;\n    src=&quot;https://dummyimage.com/1440x600/000/fff&quot; class=&quot;dd-img&quot; alt=&quot;Banner image description&quot; /&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "Add media queries in &lt;style> for larger backgrounds. For\noverlays or text, nest content inside, as seen in header examples.\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_banner.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines base styles for the banner, including\nfull-width, background sizing (cover/contain), and positioning\nutilities. Key modifiers include:\n\n- *-bg-top-left*: Positions background at top-left.\n- *-bg-top-center*: Positions at top-center.\n- *-bg-top-right*: Positions at top-right.\n- *-bg-center-left*: Positions at center-left.\n- *-bg-center-center*: Positions at center-center (default if\n  none specified).\n- *-bg-center-right*: Positions at center-right.\n- *-bg-bottom-left*: Positions at bottom-left.\n- *-bg-bottom-center*: Positions at bottom-center.\n- *-bg-bottom-right*: Positions at bottom-right.\n- SAL data attributes for custom animations.\n  *data-sal=\"slide-up\"*\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/js/vendors/sal.js (animations)\n- source/scss/components/_dd_banner.scss (styles)\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nProvide descriptive alt text for images. If text overlays, ensure\ncontrast ratios meet WCAG. Use aria-label for decorative banners. Test\nfor keyboard focus if interactive. In CMS, enforce alt text\nrequirements and validate image formats for responsiveness."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-bar-chart",
      "slug": "components/bar-chart",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Bar Chart Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Bar Chart Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-bar-chart component renders a dependency-free set of horizontal bars for comparing labelled values.",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-bar-chart-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-bar-chart-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Bar Chart Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-bar-chart component renders a dependency-free set of horizontal\nbars for comparing labelled values. Each row pairs a text label and\nvalue with a proportional bar, so trends read clearly without any\ncharting library.\n\nThis component is ideal for score breakdowns, category comparisons,\nand lightweight report visuals. In WordPress, configure it via a\nrepeater of label and value rows with an optional tone per row. In\nDrupal, use a Paragraph type with a multi-value field for label,\nvalue, and tone.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nWrap the chart in a *dd-bar-chart* figure with a visible\n*&lt;figcaption>*. Each row uses a\n*dd-bar-chart__row* holding the label, value, and a decorative\n*dd-bar-chart__bar*. Apply a tone modifier per row where\nhelpful."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<!-- Visible caption names the figure via aria-labelledby (no duplicated string) -->\n<figure class=\"dd-bar-chart\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"barchart-cap-1\">\n  <figcaption class=\"dd-bar-chart__caption\" id=\"barchart-cap-1\">Category scores</figcaption>\n  <ul class=\"dd-bar-chart__list\">\n    <li class=\"dd-bar-chart__row -good\">\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__label\">Performance</span>\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dd-bar-chart__fill\" style=\"inline-size: 82%\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__value\">82/100</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"dd-bar-chart__row -warn\">\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__label\">On-Page</span>\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dd-bar-chart__fill\" style=\"inline-size: 64%\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__value\">64/100</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"dd-bar-chart__row -bad\">\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__label\">Security</span>\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dd-bar-chart__fill\" style=\"inline-size: 40%\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__value\">40/100</span>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</figure>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<!-- Visible caption names the figure via aria-labelledby (no duplicated string) -->\n<figure class=\"dd-bar-chart\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"barchart-cap-1\">\n  <figcaption class=\"dd-bar-chart__caption\" id=\"barchart-cap-1\">Category scores</figcaption>\n  <ul class=\"dd-bar-chart__list\">\n    <li class=\"dd-bar-chart__row -good\">\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__label\">Performance</span>\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dd-bar-chart__fill\" style=\"inline-size: 82%\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__value\">82/100</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"dd-bar-chart__row -warn\">\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__label\">On-Page</span>\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dd-bar-chart__fill\" style=\"inline-size: 64%\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__value\">64/100</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"dd-bar-chart__row -bad\">\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__label\">Security</span>\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__track\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"dd-bar-chart__fill\" style=\"inline-size: 40%\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"dd-bar-chart__value\">40/100</span>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</figure>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "Keep the row count modest so each bar and value stay legible.\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_bar_chart.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines the row layout, bar track, and fill, with tone\nmodifiers driven by design tokens. Key modifiers include:\n\n- *-good*: Success-toned fill for a healthy row.\n- *-warn*: Warning-toned fill for a middling row.\n- *-bad*: Error-toned fill for a poor row.\n- No modifier: Default fill using neutral tokens for an unclassified\n  row.\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/scss/components/_dd_bar_chart.scss (styles)\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nThe label and value text are the accessible truth; the bars are\ndecorative and marked *aria-hidden=\"true\"*. The chart is a\n*&lt;figure role=\"group\">* named via\n*aria-labelledby* pointing at the visible\n*&lt;figcaption>*, or by *aria-label* when there is no\ncaption. The value is never truncated behind the bar at a 320px width\nor 400% zoom (WCAG 1.4.10 Reflow), and the fill grow-in animation is\ngated behind *prefers-reduced-motion*."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-blockquote",
      "slug": "components/blockquote",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Blockquote Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Blockquote Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-blockquote component provides a styled blockquote for testimonials, quotes, or highlighted statements.",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-blockquote-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-blockquote-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Blockquote Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-blockquote component provides a styled blockquote for\ntestimonials, quotes, or highlighted statements. It includes optional\nelements like an icon, person's image, name, title, and JSON-LD schema\nfor SEO.\n\nThis component is ideal for testimonials sections, blog pull-quotes,\nor about pages. In WordPress, configure it via ACF fields for quote\ntext, name, title, image, and schema. In Drupal, use a Paragraph type\nwith text fields for quote and details, plus an image field, rendering\nschema dynamically.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nUse a blockquote with class *dd-blockquote* and data-sal for\nanimations. Include structured elements for icon, person details, and\ncomment. Add schema script for structured data."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<blockquote class=\"dd-blockquote\">\n  <div class=\"dd-blockquote__content dd-g\" data-sal=\"fade\">\n    <div class=\"dd-blockquote__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M21 3C21.5523 3 22 3.44772 22 4V18C22 18.5523 21.5523 19 21 19H6.455L2 22.5V4C2 3.44772 2.44772 3 3 3H21ZM20 5H4V18.385L5.76333 17H20V5ZM10.5153 7.4116L10.9616 8.1004C9.29402 9.0027 9.32317 10.4519 9.32317 10.7645C9.47827 10.7431 9.64107 10.7403 9.80236 10.7553C10.7045 10.8389 11.4156 11.5795 11.4156 12.5C11.4156 13.4665 10.6321 14.25 9.66558 14.25C9.12905 14.25 8.61598 14.0048 8.29171 13.6605C7.77658 13.1137 7.5 12.5 7.5 11.5052C7.5 9.75543 8.72825 8.18684 10.5153 7.4116ZM15.5153 7.4116L15.9616 8.1004C14.294 9.0027 14.3232 10.4519 14.3232 10.7645C14.4783 10.7431 14.6411 10.7403 14.8024 10.7553C15.7045 10.8389 16.4156 11.5795 16.4156 12.5C16.4156 13.4665 15.6321 14.25 14.6656 14.25C14.1291 14.25 13.616 14.0048 13.2917 13.6605C12.7766 13.1137 12.5 12.5 12.5 11.5052C12.5 9.75543 13.7283 8.18684 15.5153 7.4116Z\"></path></svg></div>\n    <div class=\"dd-blockquote__person dd-g l-box\">\n      <div class=\"dd-blockquote__image\">\n        <img src=\"https://dummyimage.com/400x400/000/fff\" alt=\"First Name Last Name\" />\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dd-blockquote__name-title\">\n        <span class=\"dd-blockquote__name\">First Name Last Name</span>\n        <span class=\"dd-blockquote__title\">, Title</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dd-blockquote__comment\">\n        <p>Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"http://schema.org/\",\n  \"@type\": \"Quotation\",\n  \"creator\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\n    \"name\": \"PERSONS NAME GOES HERE\"\n  },\n  \"text\": \"COMMENT COPY GOES HERE\"\n}\n</script>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<blockquote class=\"dd-blockquote\">\n  <div class=\"dd-blockquote__content dd-g\" data-sal=\"fade\">\n    <div class=\"dd-blockquote__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M21 3C21.5523 3 22 3.44772 22 4V18C22 18.5523 21.5523 19 21 19H6.455L2 22.5V4C2 3.44772 2.44772 3 3 3H21ZM20 5H4V18.385L5.76333 17H20V5ZM10.5153 7.4116L10.9616 8.1004C9.29402 9.0027 9.32317 10.4519 9.32317 10.7645C9.47827 10.7431 9.64107 10.7403 9.80236 10.7553C10.7045 10.8389 11.4156 11.5795 11.4156 12.5C11.4156 13.4665 10.6321 14.25 9.66558 14.25C9.12905 14.25 8.61598 14.0048 8.29171 13.6605C7.77658 13.1137 7.5 12.5 7.5 11.5052C7.5 9.75543 8.72825 8.18684 10.5153 7.4116ZM15.5153 7.4116L15.9616 8.1004C14.294 9.0027 14.3232 10.4519 14.3232 10.7645C14.4783 10.7431 14.6411 10.7403 14.8024 10.7553C15.7045 10.8389 16.4156 11.5795 16.4156 12.5C16.4156 13.4665 15.6321 14.25 14.6656 14.25C14.1291 14.25 13.616 14.0048 13.2917 13.6605C12.7766 13.1137 12.5 12.5 12.5 11.5052C12.5 9.75543 13.7283 8.18684 15.5153 7.4116Z\"></path></svg></div>\n    <div class=\"dd-blockquote__person dd-g l-box\">\n      <div class=\"dd-blockquote__image\">\n        <img src=\"https://dummyimage.com/400x400/000/fff\" alt=\"First Name Last Name\" />\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dd-blockquote__name-title\">\n        <span class=\"dd-blockquote__name\">First Name Last Name</span>\n        <span class=\"dd-blockquote__title\">, Title</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dd-blockquote__comment\">\n        <p>Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"http://schema.org/\",\n  \"@type\": \"Quotation\",\n  \"creator\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Person\",\n    \"name\": \"PERSONS NAME GOES HERE\"\n  },\n  \"text\": \"COMMENT COPY GOES HERE\"\n}\n</script>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "Repeat for multiple quotes in a loop, using grid for layout.\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_blockquote.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines base styles for the blockquote, including\ncentering, icons, and responsive sizing. Key modifiers include:\n\n- *-left*: Aligns content to the left.\n- *-right*: Aligns content to the right.\n- *-no-icon*: Removes the quote icon.\n- *-no-image*: Hides the person's image for text-only quotes.\n- *-compact*: Reduces spacing and sizes for inline or smaller\n  displays.\n- Utility classes for alignment.  *-x-center -y-center*\n- SAL data attributes for custom animations.\n  *data-sal=\"slide-up\"*\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/js/vendors/sal.js (animations)\n- source/scss/components/_dd_blockquote.scss (styles)\n\nFor ACF/Paragraphs integration, map fields to generate schema and\nclasses dynamically.\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nUse alt text for images. Ensure schema is accurate for SEO. Test\nreadability and contrast. In CMS, require name and quote fields, and\nvalidate image uploads for accessibility."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-card",
      "slug": "components/card",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Card Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Card Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-card component provides a flexible card layout for displaying grouped content, such as features, products, or team members.",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-card-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-card-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Card Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-card component provides a flexible card layout for displaying\ngrouped content, such as features, products, or team members. It\nsupports grids of cards with images, titles, subtitles, body text, and\nlinks, making it responsive and customizable.\n\nThis component is ideal for galleries, portfolios, or feature lists.\nIn WordPress, configure it via ACF repeater fields for card items\n(e.g., image, title, subtitle, copy, link). In Drupal, use a Paragraph\ntype with fields for each card element, rendered in a loop for\nmulti-card displays.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nWrap cards in a container with class *dd-card*. Use a grid for\nitems, each with content structure. Add SAL for fade animations and\nlazy loading for images."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<div class=\"dd-card\">\n  <div class=\"dd-card__items dd-g\"><!-- cards loop inside items -->\n    <div class=\"dd-card__item l-box dd-u-1-1 dd-u-md-12-24\" data-sal=\"slide-up\">\n      <div class=\"dd-card__body dd-g\">\n        <div class=\"dd-card__image\">\n          <img src=\"https://dummyimage.com/500x500/000/fff\" alt=\"Image description\" class=\"dd-image\" width=\"768\" height=\"287\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-card__copy l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-card__title\">\n            <h3>Card Title</h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__sub-title\">\n            <strong>Card Sub Title</strong>\n          </div>\n          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.</p>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__links dd-g\">\n            <div class=\"dd-card__link\">\n              <a href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">Card Link <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M16 12L10 18V6L16 12Z\"></path></svg></a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dd-card__item l-box dd-u-1-1 dd-u-md-12-24\" data-sal=\"slide-up\">\n      <div class=\"dd-card__body dd-g\">\n        <div class=\"dd-card__image\">\n          <img src=\"https://dummyimage.com/500x500/000/fff\" alt=\"Image description\" class=\"dd-image\" width=\"768\" height=\"287\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-card__copy l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-card__title\">\n            <h3>Card Title</h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__sub-title\">\n            <strong>Card Sub Title</strong>\n          </div>\n          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.</p>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__links dd-g\">\n            <div class=\"dd-card__link\">\n              <a href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">Card Link <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M16 12L10 18V6L16 12Z\"></path></svg></a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl\"></div>\n<div class=\"dd-card -horizontal\">\n  <div class=\"dd-card__items dd-g\"><!-- cards loop inside items -->\n    <div class=\"dd-card__item l-box dd-u-1-1\" data-sal=\"slide-up\">\n      <div class=\"dd-card__body dd-g\">\n        <div class=\"dd-card__image\">\n          <img src=\"https://dummyimage.com/500x500/000/fff\" alt=\"Image description\" class=\"dd-image\" width=\"768\" height=\"287\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-card__copy l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-card__title\">\n            <h3>Card Title</h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__sub-title\">\n            <strong>Card Sub Title</strong>\n          </div>\n          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.</p>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__links dd-g\">\n            <div class=\"dd-card__link\">\n              <a href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">Card Link <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M16 12L10 18V6L16 12Z\"></path></svg></a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dd-card__item l-box dd-u-1-1\" data-sal=\"slide-up\">\n      <div class=\"dd-card__body dd-g\">\n        <div class=\"dd-card__image\">\n          <img src=\"https://dummyimage.com/500x500/000/fff\" alt=\"Image description\" class=\"dd-image\" width=\"768\" height=\"287\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-card__copy l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-card__title\">\n            <h3>Card Title</h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__sub-title\">\n            <strong>Card Sub Title</strong>\n          </div>\n          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.</p>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__links dd-g\">\n            <div class=\"dd-card__link\">\n              <a href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">Card Link <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M16 12L10 18V6L16 12Z\"></path></svg></a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<div class=\"dd-card\">\n  <div class=\"dd-card__items dd-g\"><!-- cards loop inside items -->\n\n    <div class=\"dd-card__item l-box dd-u-1-1 dd-u-md-12-24\" data-sal=\"slide-up\">\n      <div class=\"dd-card__body dd-g\">\n        <div class=\"dd-card__image\">\n          <img src=\"https://dummyimage.com/500x500/000/fff\" alt=\"Image description\" class=\"dd-image\" width=\"768\" height=\"287\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-card__copy l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-card__title\">\n            <h3>Card Title</h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__sub-title\">\n            <strong>Card Sub Title</strong>\n          </div>\n          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.</p>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__links dd-g\">\n            <div class=\"dd-card__link\">\n              <a href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">Card Link <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M16 12L10 18V6L16 12Z\"></path></svg></a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"dd-card__item l-box dd-u-1-1 dd-u-md-12-24\" data-sal=\"slide-up\">\n      <div class=\"dd-card__body dd-g\">\n        <div class=\"dd-card__image\">\n          <img src=\"https://dummyimage.com/500x500/000/fff\" alt=\"Image description\" class=\"dd-image\" width=\"768\" height=\"287\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-card__copy l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-card__title\">\n            <h3>Card Title</h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__sub-title\">\n            <strong>Card Sub Title</strong>\n          </div>\n          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.</p>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__links dd-g\">\n            <div class=\"dd-card__link\">\n              <a href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">Card Link <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M16 12L10 18V6L16 12Z\"></path></svg></a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"dd-card -horizontal\">\n  <div class=\"dd-card__items dd-g\"><!-- cards loop inside items -->\n\n    <div class=\"dd-card__item l-box dd-u-1-1\" data-sal=\"slide-up\">\n      <div class=\"dd-card__body dd-g\">\n        <div class=\"dd-card__image\">\n          <img src=\"https://dummyimage.com/500x500/000/fff\" alt=\"Image description\" class=\"dd-image\" width=\"768\" height=\"287\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-card__copy l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-card__title\">\n            <h3>Card Title</h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__sub-title\">\n            <strong>Card Sub Title</strong>\n          </div>\n          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.</p>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__links dd-g\">\n            <div class=\"dd-card__link\">\n              <a href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">Card Link <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M16 12L10 18V6L16 12Z\"></path></svg></a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"dd-card__item l-box dd-u-1-1\" data-sal=\"slide-up\">\n      <div class=\"dd-card__body dd-g\">\n        <div class=\"dd-card__image\">\n          <img src=\"https://dummyimage.com/500x500/000/fff\" alt=\"Image description\" class=\"dd-image\" width=\"768\" height=\"287\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-card__copy l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-card__title\">\n            <h3>Card Title</h3>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__sub-title\">\n            <strong>Card Sub Title</strong>\n          </div>\n          <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.</p>\n          <div class=\"dd-card__links dd-g\">\n            <div class=\"dd-card__link\">\n              <a href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">Card Link <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M16 12L10 18V6L16 12Z\"></path></svg></a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "Use grid classes like dd-u-md-12-24 for responsive columns (e.g.,\n2-column on medium screens).\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_card.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines base styles for cards, including borders,\nshadows, and responsive grids. Key modifiers include:\n\n- *-horizontal*: Lays out card content horizontally (image\n  left, copy right) instead of vertical.\n- *-no-image*: Hides the image for text-only cards.\n- Utility classes for alignment.  *-x-center -y-center*\n- SAL data attributes for custom animations.\n  *data-sal=\"slide-up\"*\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/js/vendors/sal.js (animations)\n- source/scss/components/_dd_card.scss (styles)\n\nFor ACF/Paragraphs integration, use repeater fields to generate cards\ndynamically, with optional fields for modifiers.\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nUse alt text for images and semantic headings in titles. Ensure links\nare descriptive. Add role=\"list\" to items for screen readers if in a\ngrid. Test keyboard navigation and focus styles. In CMS, require alt\ntext and validate content for completeness."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-cta",
      "slug": "components/cta",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "CTA Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "CTA Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-cta component provides a prominent call-to-action section with a background image or video, overlaid content (title, body, links), and flexible...",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-cta-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-cta-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# CTA Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-cta component provides a prominent call-to-action section with\na background image or video, overlaid content (title, body, links),\nand flexible positioning for the copy block. It's designed for\nconversions like sign-ups, downloads, or contact forms, with\nresponsive overlays for readability.\n\nThis component is ideal for hero CTAs, mid-page promotions, or\nfooters. In WordPress, configure it via ACF fields for background\nimage, title, copy, links, and position select. In Drupal, use a\nParagraph type with media field for background, text fields for\ncontent, and multi-value fields for links, rendering positioning via a\nselect widget.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nWrap the CTA in a div with class *dd-cta*. Include an image for\nbackground (hidden on desktop for CSS background), content overlay\nwith title, body, and links. Use grid for link alignment."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<div class=\"dd-cta -top-left\">\n  <div class=\"dd-cta__image\">\n    <picture>\n      <source srcset=\"\n        https://dummyimage.com/720x405/000000/fff 720w,\n        https://dummyimage.com/1920x1080/000000/fff 1440w\"\n      sizes=\"(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px\">\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/cta-bg-sm.webp\" class=\"dd-img\" alt=\"CTA alt tag\" />\n    </picture>\n  </div>\n  <style>\n    .dd-cta .dd-cta__image {\n      background-image: url(\"https://dummyimage.com/720x405/000000/fff\");\n    }\n    @media only screen and (min-width: 64em) {\n      .dd-cta .dd-cta__image {\n        background-image: url(\"https://dummyimage.com/1920x1080/000000/fff\");\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n  <div class=\"dd-cta__content dd-g\" data-sal=\"slide-up\" data-sal-duration=\"1000\" data-sal-delay=\"0\">\n    <div class=\"dd-cta__copy dd-u-1-1 dd-u-md-12-24\">\n      <div class=\"dd-cta__title\">\n        <h2>CTA Title</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dd-cta__subtitle\">\n        <strong>CTA Subtitle</strong>\n      </div>\n      <p>CTA body copy</p>\n      <div class=\"dd-cta__links dd-g -x-center\">\n        <div class=\"dd-cta__link\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">CTA Link 1</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-cta__link\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -ghost\">CTA Link 2</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;div class=&quot;dd-cta -top-left&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;dd-cta__image&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;picture&gt;\n      &lt;source srcset=&quot;\n        https://dummyimage.com/720x405/000000/fff 720w,\n        https://dummyimage.com/1920x1080/000000/fff 1440w&quot;\n      sizes=&quot;(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;img src=&quot;/assets/imgs/cta-bg-sm.webp&quot; class=&quot;dd-img&quot; alt=&quot;CTA alt tag&quot; /&gt;\n    &lt;/picture&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;style&gt;\n    .dd-cta .dd-cta__image {\n      background-image: url(&quot;https://dummyimage.com/720x405/000000/fff&quot;);\n    }\n    @media only screen and (min-width: 64em) {\n      .dd-cta .dd-cta__image {\n        background-image: url(&quot;https://dummyimage.com/1920x1080/000000/fff&quot;);\n      }\n    }\n  &lt;/style&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;dd-cta__content dd-g&quot; data-sal=&quot;slide-up&quot; data-sal-duration=&quot;1000&quot; data-sal-delay=&quot;0&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;dd-cta__copy dd-u-1-1 dd-u-md-12-24&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;dd-cta__title&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;h2&gt;CTA Title&lt;/h2&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;dd-cta__subtitle&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;strong&gt;CTA Subtitle&lt;/strong&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;p&gt;CTA body copy&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;dd-cta__links dd-g -x-center&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;dd-cta__link&quot;&gt;\n          &lt;a href=&quot;#&quot; class=&quot;dd-button -primary&quot;&gt;CTA Link 1&lt;/a&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;dd-cta__link&quot;&gt;\n          &lt;a href=&quot;#&quot; class=&quot;dd-button -ghost&quot;&gt;CTA Link 2&lt;/a&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n</code></pre>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "Set background via inline style or CSS class; use responsive image for\nmobile.\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_cta.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines base styles for the CTA, including cover\nbackgrounds and content positioning. Key modifiers for\n.dd-cta include:\n\n- *-top-left*: Positions copy at top-left of background.\n- *-top-center*: Positions at top-center.\n- *-top-right*: Positions at top-right.\n- *-center-left*: Positions at center-left.\n- *-center-center*: Positions at center-center (default).\n- *-center-right*: Positions at center-right.\n- *-bottom-left*: Positions at bottom-left.\n- *-bottom-center*: Positions at bottom-center.\n- *-bottom-right*: Positions at bottom-right.\n- Utility classes for alignment.  *-x-center -y-center*\n- SAL data attributes for custom animations.\n  *data-sal=\"slide-up\"*\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/js/vendors/sal.js (animations)\n- source/scss/components/_dd_cta.scss (styles)\n\nFor ACF/Paragraphs integration, map fields to generate inline styles\nand classes dynamically.\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nEnsure overlay text contrasts with background (use borders/opacity).\nProvide alt text for images if visible. Use semantic headings for\ntitles. Test focus on links. In CMS, validate background images for\nrequired fields and enforce contrast checks if possible."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-data-table",
      "slug": "components/data-table",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Data Table Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Data Table Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-data-table component is an accessible table with a caption, scoped header cells, and optional status cells that embed the dd-badge component.",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-data-table-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-data-table-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Data Table Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-data-table component is an accessible table with a caption,\nscoped header cells, and optional status cells that embed the dd-badge\ncomponent. It wraps the table in a keyboard-focusable horizontal\nscroll region and supports optional column sorting and an empty state.\n\nThis component is ideal for report data, comparison grids, and audit\nresult listings. In WordPress, configure it via a repeater of rows and\na header definition, with a status column mapped to badge severities.\nIn Drupal, use a Views table or a Paragraph type with structured field\ndata.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nWrap a semantic *&lt;table>* with a *&lt;caption>*\nand *&lt;th scope>* headers inside the\n*dd-data-table* container. Status cells embed a dd-badge, and\nsortable columns use native header buttons. The scroll region and\nsorting behaviour are wired up by the component JS."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<!-- The scroll region's tabindex/role/aria-label are added by JS only when the\n     table overflows; data-label supplies the accessible name. -->\n<div class=\"dd-data-table\">\n  <div class=\"dd-data-table__scroll\" data-label=\"Prioritized remediation tasks\">\n    <table class=\"dd-data-table__table\" id=\"task-table\">\n      <caption class=\"dd-data-table__caption\">Prioritized remediation tasks</caption>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"col\" class=\"dd-data-table__th\" data-align=\"start\">ID</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\" class=\"dd-data-table__th\" data-align=\"start\" aria-sort=\"none\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"dd-data-table__sort\" data-sort-key=\"priority\">Priority<span class=\"dd-data-table__sort-ind\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n          </th>\n          <th scope=\"col\" class=\"dd-data-table__th\" data-align=\"start\">Finding</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\" class=\"dd-data-table__th\" data-align=\"end\" aria-sort=\"none\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"dd-data-table__sort\" data-sort-key=\"effort\">Effort<span class=\"dd-data-table__sort-ind\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n          </th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr class=\"dd-data-table__row\">\n          <th scope=\"row\" class=\"dd-data-table__td\" data-align=\"start\">SEO-001</th>\n          <td class=\"dd-data-table__td\"><span class=\"dd-badge -critical\"><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Critical</span></span></td>\n          <td class=\"dd-data-table__td\">Missing &lt;title&gt; tag</td>\n          <td class=\"dd-data-table__td\" data-align=\"end\">2h</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"dd-data-table__row\">\n          <th scope=\"row\" class=\"dd-data-table__td\" data-align=\"start\">SEO-002</th>\n          <td class=\"dd-data-table__td\"><span class=\"dd-badge -warning\"><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Warning</span></span></td>\n          <td class=\"dd-data-table__td\">Thin meta description</td>\n          <td class=\"dd-data-table__td\" data-align=\"end\">1h</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<!-- The scroll region's tabindex/role/aria-label are added by JS only when the\n     table overflows; data-label supplies the accessible name. -->\n<div class=\"dd-data-table\">\n  <div class=\"dd-data-table__scroll\" data-label=\"Prioritized remediation tasks\">\n    <table class=\"dd-data-table__table\" id=\"task-table\">\n      <caption class=\"dd-data-table__caption\">Prioritized remediation tasks</caption>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"col\" class=\"dd-data-table__th\" data-align=\"start\">ID</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\" class=\"dd-data-table__th\" data-align=\"start\" aria-sort=\"none\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"dd-data-table__sort\" data-sort-key=\"priority\">Priority<span class=\"dd-data-table__sort-ind\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n          </th>\n          <th scope=\"col\" class=\"dd-data-table__th\" data-align=\"start\">Finding</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\" class=\"dd-data-table__th\" data-align=\"end\" aria-sort=\"none\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"dd-data-table__sort\" data-sort-key=\"effort\">Effort<span class=\"dd-data-table__sort-ind\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n          </th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr class=\"dd-data-table__row\">\n          <th scope=\"row\" class=\"dd-data-table__td\" data-align=\"start\">SEO-001</th>\n          <td class=\"dd-data-table__td\"><span class=\"dd-badge -critical\"><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Critical</span></span></td>\n          <td class=\"dd-data-table__td\">Missing &lt;title&gt; tag</td>\n          <td class=\"dd-data-table__td\" data-align=\"end\">2h</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"dd-data-table__row\">\n          <th scope=\"row\" class=\"dd-data-table__td\" data-align=\"start\">SEO-002</th>\n          <td class=\"dd-data-table__td\"><span class=\"dd-badge -warning\"><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Warning</span></span></td>\n          <td class=\"dd-data-table__td\">Thin meta description</td>\n          <td class=\"dd-data-table__td\" data-align=\"end\">1h</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "Provide an empty state row when there is no data to display.\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_data_table.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines the table layout, cell padding, scroll region,\nand focus styling. Key modifiers include:\n\n- *-dense*: Reduces cell padding for compact, data-heavy\n  tables.\n- No modifier: Default comfortable spacing for standard readability.\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/js/components/_dd_data_table.js (scroll region and sort)\n- source/scss/components/_dd_data_table.scss (styles)\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nThe *&lt;caption>* names the table, and header cells use\n*&lt;th scope>* for correct association. The scroll region\nreceives *tabindex=\"0\"*, *role=\"region\"*, and an\n*aria-label* from the JS only when it actually overflows, so\nkeyboard users can scroll without adding an empty tab stop otherwise.\nSortable headers are native *&lt;button>* elements with\n*aria-sort* set on the *&lt;th>* (exactly one column\nnon-none at a time), and sorting is fully keyboard-operable. The focus\nring uses a high-contrast dark colour rather than the brand green so\nit stays visible on all cell backgrounds."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-filmstrip",
      "slug": "components/filmstrip",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Filmstrip Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Filmstrip Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-filmstrip component provides a marque like section that has an infinite scroll with a pause effect on hover.",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-filmstrip-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-filmstrip-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Filmstrip Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-filmstrip component provides a marque like section that has an infinite scroll with a pause effect on hover.\n\nThis component is ideal for showing logos or small thumbnail images that continually scroll.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nWrap the Filmstrip in a div with class *dd-filmstrip*. Use an unordered list to show images."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<div class=\"dd-filmstrip\">\n  <ul class=\"dd-filmstrip__content\">\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>1</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>2</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>3</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>4</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>5</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>6</figure>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n  <ul aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"dd-filmstrip__content\">\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>1</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>2</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>3</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>4</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>5</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>6</figure>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spacer -divider\"></div>\n<div class=\"dd-filmstrip -reverse\">\n  <ul class=\"dd-filmstrip__content\">\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>1</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>2</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>3</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>4</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>5</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>6</figure>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n  <ul aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"dd-filmstrip__content\">\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>1</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>2</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>3</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>4</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>5</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>6</figure>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<div class=\"dd-filmstrip\">\n  <ul class=\"dd-filmstrip__content\">\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>1</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>2</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>3</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>4</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>5</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>6</figure>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <ul aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"dd-filmstrip__content\">\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>1</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>2</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>3</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>4</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>5</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>6</figure>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"spacer -divider\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"dd-filmstrip -reverse\">\n  <ul class=\"dd-filmstrip__content\">\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>1</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>2</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>3</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>4</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>5</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>6</figure>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <ul aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"dd-filmstrip__content\">\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>1</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>2</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>3</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>4</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>5</figure>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC. logo\" />\n      <figure>6</figure>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "Use responsive image for mobile.\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_filmstrip.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines base styles for the Filmstrip, animation direction. Key modifiers for\n.dd-filmstrip include:\n\n- *-reverset*: reverse the play head.\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/scss/components/_dd_filmstrip.scss (styles)\n\nFor ACF/Paragraphs integration, map fields to generate inline styles\nand classes dynamically.\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nEnsure overlay text contrasts with background (use borders/opacity).\nProvide alt text for images if visible. In CMS, validate background images for\nrequired fields and enforce contrast checks if possible."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-finding",
      "slug": "components/finding",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Finding Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Finding Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-finding component renders a list of audit findings, where each item combines a severity badge (embedding dd-badge), a title, and optional evidence...",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-finding-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-finding-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Finding Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-finding component renders a list of audit findings, where each\nitem combines a severity badge (embedding dd-badge), a title, and\noptional evidence and fix details. An accent stripe reinforces the\nseverity for quick visual scanning.\n\nThis component is ideal for accessibility, SEO, and security audit\nreports where issues need to be listed with clear priority. In\nWordPress, configure it via a repeater of findings with severity,\ntitle, evidence, and fix fields. In Drupal, use a Paragraph type with\na select for severity and text areas for evidence and fix.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nWrap the findings in a *dd-finding* list, using\n*&lt;ol>* when the order communicates priority or\n*&lt;ul>* when it does not. Each\n*dd-finding__item* holds a severity dd-badge, a title heading,\nand optional evidence and fix blocks. Apply the matching stripe\nmodifier per item."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<div class=\"dd-finding\">\n  <h4 class=\"dd-finding__heading\">Priority findings</h4>\n  <ol class=\"dd-finding__list\">\n    <li class=\"dd-finding__item -critical\">\n      <span class=\"dd-finding__badge\"><span class=\"dd-badge -critical\"><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Critical</span></span></span>\n      <div class=\"dd-finding__body\">\n        <p class=\"dd-finding__title\">Missing &lt;title&gt; tag</p>\n        <p class=\"dd-finding__evidence\">No &lt;title&gt; in &lt;head&gt;.</p>\n        <p class=\"dd-finding__fix\"><span class=\"dd-finding__fix-label\">Fix:</span> Add a unique 50–60 char title.</p>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"dd-finding__item -info\">\n      <span class=\"dd-finding__badge\"><span class=\"dd-badge -info\"><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Info</span></span></span>\n      <div class=\"dd-finding__body\">\n        <p class=\"dd-finding__title\">Striking-distance query ‘web design’ at position 12</p>\n        <p class=\"dd-finding__evidence\">4,200 impressions, 0.8% CTR.</p>\n        <p class=\"dd-finding__fix\"><span class=\"dd-finding__fix-label\">Fix:</span> Strengthen on-page relevance and internal links.</p>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"dd-finding__item -pass\">\n      <span class=\"dd-finding__badge\"><span class=\"dd-badge -pass\"><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Pass</span></span></span>\n      <div class=\"dd-finding__body\">\n        <p class=\"dd-finding__title\">Canonical tags present on all pages</p>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n</div>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<div class=\"dd-finding\">\n  <h4 class=\"dd-finding__heading\">Priority findings</h4>\n  <ol class=\"dd-finding__list\">\n    <li class=\"dd-finding__item -critical\">\n      <span class=\"dd-finding__badge\"><span class=\"dd-badge -critical\"><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Critical</span></span></span>\n      <div class=\"dd-finding__body\">\n        <p class=\"dd-finding__title\">Missing &lt;title&gt; tag</p>\n        <p class=\"dd-finding__evidence\">No &lt;title&gt; in &lt;head&gt;.</p>\n        <p class=\"dd-finding__fix\"><span class=\"dd-finding__fix-label\">Fix:</span> Add a unique 50–60 char title.</p>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"dd-finding__item -info\">\n      <span class=\"dd-finding__badge\"><span class=\"dd-badge -info\"><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Info</span></span></span>\n      <div class=\"dd-finding__body\">\n        <p class=\"dd-finding__title\">Striking-distance query ‘web design’ at position 12</p>\n        <p class=\"dd-finding__evidence\">4,200 impressions, 0.8% CTR.</p>\n        <p class=\"dd-finding__fix\"><span class=\"dd-finding__fix-label\">Fix:</span> Strengthen on-page relevance and internal links.</p>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"dd-finding__item -pass\">\n      <span class=\"dd-finding__badge\"><span class=\"dd-badge -pass\"><span class=\"dd-badge__label\">Pass</span></span></span>\n      <div class=\"dd-finding__body\">\n        <p class=\"dd-finding__title\">Canonical tags present on all pages</p>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n</div>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "Order findings by severity when using the ordered list form.\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_finding.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines the item layout, accent stripe, and spacing for\nevidence and fix blocks, with stripe modifiers driven by design\ntokens. Key modifiers include:\n\n- *-critical*: Error-toned accent stripe for critical findings.\n- *-warning*: Warning-toned accent stripe for warnings.\n- *-info*: Info-toned accent stripe for informational notes.\n- *-pass*: Success-toned accent stripe for passing checks.\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/scss/components/_dd_badge.scss (embedded severity badge)\n- source/scss/components/_dd_finding.scss (styles)\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nFindings use real list semantics with *&lt;ol>* or\n*&lt;ul>* so assistive technology announces the count and\nposition (WCAG 1.3.1 Info and Relationships). Severity is stated by the\nbadge word, not the stripe colour alone (WCAG 1.4.1 Use of Colour). The\nfinding title heading level continues the page outline without skipping\nlevels (WCAG 1.3.1), and any inline links inside evidence or fix keep\ntheir underline and a visible focus indicator."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-hero",
      "slug": "components/hero",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Hero Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Hero Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-hero component provides a prominent introductory section, typically at the top of a page, featuring a large background image with overlaid content...",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-hero-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-hero-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Hero Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-hero component provides a prominent introductory section,\ntypically at the top of a page, featuring a large background image\nwith overlaid content like titles, body text, and calls-to-action.\nIt's designed for engaging headers with responsive backgrounds and\nflexible content alignment.\n\nThis component is ideal for homepages, landing pages, or section\nintros. In WordPress, configure it via ACF fields for hero image (with\nsrcset), title, body, links, and aria-label. In Drupal, use a\nParagraph type with media field for image, text fields for content,\nand optional link fields, rendering responsive attributes dynamically.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nUse a section with class *dd-hero* and aria-label for\naccessibility. Include an image with srcset for responsiveness, and\ncontent with title, body, and optional links."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<section class=\"dd-hero\" id=\"dd-0001\" aria-label=\"Introduction\">\n  <div class=\"dd-hero__image\">\n    <picture>\n      <source srcset=\"\n      https://dummyimage.com/720x405/000000/fff 320w,\n      https://dummyimage.com/1024x505/000000/fff 720w,\n      https://dummyimage.com/1920x1080/000000/fff 1440w\"\n      sizes=\"(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px\">\n      <img src=\"https://dummyimage.com/1920x1080/000000/fff\" class=\"dd-img\" alt=\"Hero image description\" />\n    </picture>\n  </div>\n  <style>\n    .dd-hero__image {\n      background-image: url('https://dummyimage.com/720x405/000000/fff');\n    }\n    @media only screen and (min-width: 64em) {\n      .dd-hero__image {\n        background-image: url('https://dummyimage.com/1920x1080/000000/fff');\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n  <div class=\"dd-hero__content dd-g\" data-sal=\"fade\">\n    <div class=\"dd-hero__copy dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\">\n      <div class=\"dd-hero__title\">\n        <h1>Hero Title</h1>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dd-hero__subtitle\">\n        <strong>Subtitle</strong>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dd-hero__body\">\n        <p>Hero Body Copy</p>\n        <div class=\"dd-hero__links dd-g\">\n          <div class=\"dd-hero__link\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">Hero Link 1</a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-hero__link\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -ghost\">Hero Link 2</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<pre><code class=\"language-html\">&lt;section class=&quot;dd-hero&quot; id=&quot;dd-0001&quot; aria-label=&quot;Introduction&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;dd-hero__image&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;picture&gt;\n      &lt;source srcset=&quot;\n      https://dummyimage.com/720x405/000000/fff 320w,\n      https://dummyimage.com/1024x505/000000/fff 720w,\n      https://dummyimage.com/1920x1080/000000/fff 1440w&quot;\n      sizes=&quot;(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;img src=&quot;https://dummyimage.com/1920x1080/000000/fff&quot; class=&quot;dd-img&quot; alt=&quot;Hero image description&quot; /&gt;\n    &lt;/picture&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;style&gt;\n    .dd-hero__image {\n      background-image: url(&#39;https://dummyimage.com/720x405/000000/fff&#39;);\n    }\n    @media only screen and (min-width: 64em) {\n      .dd-hero__image {\n        background-image: url(&#39;https://dummyimage.com/1920x1080/000000/fff&#39;);\n      }\n    }\n  &lt;/style&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;dd-hero__content dd-g&quot; data-sal=&quot;fade&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;dd-hero__copy dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;dd-hero__title&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;h1&gt;Hero Title&lt;/h1&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;dd-hero__subtitle&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;strong&gt;Subtitle&lt;/strong&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;dd-hero__body&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;p&gt;Hero Body Copy&lt;/p&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;dd-hero__links dd-g&quot;&gt;\n          &lt;div class=&quot;dd-hero__link&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;a href=&quot;#&quot; class=&quot;dd-button -primary&quot;&gt;Hero Link 1&lt;/a&gt;\n          &lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div class=&quot;dd-hero__link&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;a href=&quot;#&quot; class=&quot;dd-button -ghost&quot;&gt;Hero Link 2&lt;/a&gt;\n          &lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/section&gt;\n</code></pre>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "Nest within a full-width section for layout; use CSS for background\npositioning on larger screens.\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_hero.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines base styles for the hero, including absolute\npositioning for images on desktop, flexible content alignment, and\nresponsive heights. Key modifiers include:\n\n- *-left*: Aligns content to the left.\n- *-center*: Centers content (default for mobile).\n- *-right*: Aligns content to the right.\n- *-overlay-light*: Adds a semi-transparent overlay for better\n  text readability on images.\n- *-overlay-dark*: Adds a darker semi-transparent overlay for\n  better text readability on images.\n- Utility classes for alignment.  *-x-center -y-center*\n- SAL data attributes for custom animations.\n  *data-sal=\"slide-up\"*\n\nFor ACF/Paragraphs integration, map image fields to generate srcset\nand classes dynamically.\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/js/vendors/sal.js (animations)\n- source/scss/components/_dd_hero.scss (styles)\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nUse aria-label for the section. Provide descriptive alt text for\nimages. Ensure text contrasts with backgrounds. Test keyboard focus on\nlinks. In CMS, enforce alt text and aria requirements, and validate\nfor mobile stacking order."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-milestones",
      "slug": "components/milestones",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Milestones Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Milestones Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-milestones component provides a grid of milestone or statistic blocks, featuring animated percentage counters, titles, subtitles, copy, and optional...",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-milestones-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-milestones-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Milestones Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-milestones component provides a grid of milestone or statistic\nblocks, featuring animated percentage counters, titles, subtitles,\ncopy, and optional links. It's designed for showcasing achievements,\nstats, or key metrics with visual animations for engagement.\n\nThis component is ideal for about pages, dashboards, or impact\nreports. In WordPress, configure it via ACF repeater fields for\nmilestone items (e.g., number, title, subtitle, copy, link). In\nDrupal, use a Paragraph type with fields for each milestone element,\nrendered in a grid loop.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nWrap milestones in a div with class *dd-milestones*. Use a grid\nfor items, each with a body containing the percentage (with\ndata-number), title, subtitle, copy, and link. Add SAL for fade\nanimations."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<div class=\"dd-milestones\">\n  <div class=\"dd-milestones__content\">\n    <div class=\"dd-milestones__items dd-g\"><!-- milestones loop inside items -->\n      <div class=\"dd-milestones__item dd-u-12-24 dd-u-sm-12-24 dd-u-md-12-24 dd-u-lg-8-24 l-box\" data-sal=\"slide-up\">\n        <div class=\"dd-milestones__body l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-milestones__percentage\" data-number=\"70\"><span class=\"number\">70</span>%</div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__title\"><h2>Title</h2></div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__subtitle\"><strong>Subtitle</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__copy\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__link\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button\">Link</a></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dd-milestones__item dd-u-12-24 dd-u-sm-12-24 dd-u-md-12-24 dd-u-lg-8-24 l-box\" data-sal=\"slide-up\">\n        <div class=\"dd-milestones__body l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-milestones__percentage\" data-number=\"80\"><span class=\"number\">70</span>%</div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__title\"><h2>Title</h2></div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__subtitle\"><strong>Subtitle</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__copy\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__link\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button\">Link</a></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dd-milestones__item dd-u-12-24 dd-u-sm-12-24 dd-u-md-12-24 dd-u-lg-8-24 l-box\" data-sal=\"slide-up\">\n        <div class=\"dd-milestones__body l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-milestones__percentage\" data-number=\"90\"><span class=\"number\">70</span>%</div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__title\"><h2>Title</h2></div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__subtitle\"><strong>Subtitle</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__copy\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__link\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button\">Link</a></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<div class=\"dd-milestones\">\n  <div class=\"dd-milestones__content\">\n    <div class=\"dd-milestones__items dd-g\"><!-- milestones loop inside items -->\n\n      <div class=\"dd-milestones__item dd-u-12-24 dd-u-sm-12-24 dd-u-md-12-24 dd-u-lg-8-24 l-box\" data-sal=\"slide-up\">\n        <div class=\"dd-milestones__body l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-milestones__percentage\" data-number=\"70\"><span class=\"number\">70</span>%</div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__title\"><h2>Title</h2></div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__subtitle\"><strong>Subtitle</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__copy\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__link\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button\">Link</a></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dd-milestones__item dd-u-12-24 dd-u-sm-12-24 dd-u-md-12-24 dd-u-lg-8-24 l-box\" data-sal=\"slide-up\">\n        <div class=\"dd-milestones__body l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-milestones__percentage\" data-number=\"80\"><span class=\"number\">70</span>%</div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__title\"><h2>Title</h2></div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__subtitle\"><strong>Subtitle</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__copy\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__link\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button\">Link</a></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dd-milestones__item dd-u-12-24 dd-u-sm-12-24 dd-u-md-12-24 dd-u-lg-8-24 l-box\" data-sal=\"slide-up\">\n        <div class=\"dd-milestones__body l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-milestones__percentage\" data-number=\"90\"><span class=\"number\">70</span>%</div>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__title\"><h2>Title</h2></div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__subtitle\"><strong>Subtitle</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__copy\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</div>\n            <div class=\"dd-milestones__link\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button\">Link</a></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "The data-number drives the animation; grid classes control responsive\ncolumns (e.g., 3-column on large screens).\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_milestones.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines base styles for milestones, including grid\nlayout, shadows on bodies, and animation classes for visibility. Key\nmodifiers include:\n\n- *-horizontal*: Adjusts for horizontal item flow if needed.\n- Utility classes like SAL data attributes (e.g.,\n  *data-sal=\"slide-up\"*) for custom entrances, or grid utilities\n  for column adjustments.\n\n## Associated JavaScript (from dd_milestones.js)\n\nThe component includes a JS file for animating the percentage\ncounters, triggered on window load (or via dd_animate.js) to increment\nnumbers from 0 to data-number value.\n\nFor ACF/Paragraphs integration, map number fields to data-number\nattributes dynamically.\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/js/_dd_milestones.js (animations)\n- source/js/vendors/sal.js (animations)\n- source/scss/components/_dd_milestones.scss (styles)\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nUse aria-live for dynamic counter updates if needed. Ensure colors\ncontrast for percentages. Add units or labels for clarity. Test screen\nreader announcements of final values. In CMS, validate number fields\nas integers and provide fallbacks for no-JS (show final value\nstatically)."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-modal",
      "slug": "components/modal",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Modal Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Modal Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-modal component provides a dialog-based modal window for displaying content overlays.",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-modal-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-modal-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Modal Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-modal component provides a dialog-based modal window for\ndisplaying content overlays. It uses the native HTML5 dialog element\nfor built-in accessibility and focus management, ensuring it works\nprogressively with or without JavaScript enhancements.\n\nThis component is ideal for alerts, forms, confirmations, or\nadditional content displays. In WordPress, configure it via ACF fields\nfor modal triggers and content. In Drupal, use Paragraphs with fields\nfor button text, modal content, and IDs.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nUse buttons with *data-modal-open* and\n*data-id* attributes to open modals. The modal itself uses\ndialog with *data-modal* and a matching *id*. Include a\nclose button with *data-modal-close* and\n*data-id* inside the modal."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<button data-modal-open data-id=\"example-modal\">Open Modal</button>\n<dialog data-modal id=\"example-modal\" class=\"dd-modal\">\n  <button data-modal-close data-id=\"example-modal\" aria-label=\"close modal window\">X</button>\n  <div class=\"dd-modal__content\">\n    <p>Modal content here.</p>\n  </div>\n</dialog>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<button data-modal-open data-id=\"example-modal\">Open Modal</button>\n<dialog data-modal id=\"example-modal\" class=\"dd-modal\">\n  <button data-modal-close data-id=\"example-modal\" aria-label=\"close modal window\">X</button>\n  <div class=\"dd-modal__content\">\n    <p>Modal content here.</p>\n  </div>\n</dialog>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## CSS Modifiers\n\nBase styles for the modal include backdrop blur, centering, and\nresponsive sizing.\n\n- *[open]*: Applied when the dialog is open, for styling the\n  backdrop and modal.\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/js/_dd_modal.js (animations)\n- source/scss/components/_dd_modal.scss (styles)\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nThe dialog element provides automatic focus management and keyboard\nnavigation (ESC to close). Ensure close buttons have proper\n*aria-label*. Test with screen readers. In CMS, ensure modal\ncontent is meaningful and avoid nesting interactive elements."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-score-ring",
      "slug": "components/score-ring",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Score Ring Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Score Ring Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-score-ring component is a radial SVG donut gauge that displays a score against a maximum, with a visible number and a short label.",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-score-ring-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-score-ring-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Score Ring Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-score-ring component is a radial SVG donut gauge that displays\na score against a maximum, with a visible number and a short label. An\narc sweeps proportionally to the value to give an immediate sense of\nhow full or complete a score is.\n\nThis component is ideal for audit scores, health indicators, and KPI\nsummaries, and it supports an optional link form so the whole gauge\ncan navigate to a detail view. In WordPress, configure it via ACF\nfields for score, max, tone, and an optional URL. In Drupal, use a\nParagraph type with number fields for score and max plus a select for\ntone.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nWrap the gauge in a container with class *dd-score-ring*\ncontaining an inline SVG for the arc, a visible number, and a\n*dd-score-ring__label*. Use the figure form for a static gauge\nor the *-link* anchor form to make it navigable."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<!-- Static figure form: svg carries the accessible name -->\n<div class=\"dd-score-ring -good\">\n  <svg class=\"dd-score-ring__svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Performance: 82 out of 100\">\n    <circle class=\"dd-score-ring__track\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" />\n    <circle class=\"dd-score-ring__value\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"263.9\" stroke-dashoffset=\"47.5\" transform=\"rotate(-90 50 50)\" />\n    <text class=\"dd-score-ring__num\" x=\"50\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">82</text>\n  </svg>\n  <div class=\"dd-score-ring__label\">Performance</div>\n  <div class=\"dd-score-ring__sub\">13 checks</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Warn tone -->\n<div class=\"dd-score-ring -warn\">\n  <svg class=\"dd-score-ring__svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"On-Page: 64 out of 100\">\n    <circle class=\"dd-score-ring__track\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" />\n    <circle class=\"dd-score-ring__value\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"263.9\" stroke-dashoffset=\"95.0\" transform=\"rotate(-90 50 50)\" />\n    <text class=\"dd-score-ring__num\" x=\"50\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64</text>\n  </svg>\n  <div class=\"dd-score-ring__label\">On-Page</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Link form: the <a> owns the name, the svg is decorative -->\n<a class=\"dd-score-ring -bad -link\" href=\"#section-security\" aria-label=\"Security: 40 out of 100. View details\">\n  <svg class=\"dd-score-ring__svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <circle class=\"dd-score-ring__track\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" />\n    <circle class=\"dd-score-ring__value\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"263.9\" stroke-dashoffset=\"158.3\" transform=\"rotate(-90 50 50)\" />\n    <text class=\"dd-score-ring__num\" x=\"50\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</text>\n  </svg>\n  <div class=\"dd-score-ring__label\">Security</div>\n  <div class=\"dd-score-ring__sub\">View details</div>\n</a>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<!-- Static figure form: svg carries the accessible name -->\n<div class=\"dd-score-ring -good\">\n  <svg class=\"dd-score-ring__svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Performance: 82 out of 100\">\n    <circle class=\"dd-score-ring__track\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" />\n    <circle class=\"dd-score-ring__value\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"263.9\" stroke-dashoffset=\"47.5\" transform=\"rotate(-90 50 50)\" />\n    <text class=\"dd-score-ring__num\" x=\"50\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">82</text>\n  </svg>\n  <div class=\"dd-score-ring__label\">Performance</div>\n  <div class=\"dd-score-ring__sub\">13 checks</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Warn tone -->\n<div class=\"dd-score-ring -warn\">\n  <svg class=\"dd-score-ring__svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"On-Page: 64 out of 100\">\n    <circle class=\"dd-score-ring__track\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" />\n    <circle class=\"dd-score-ring__value\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"263.9\" stroke-dashoffset=\"95.0\" transform=\"rotate(-90 50 50)\" />\n    <text class=\"dd-score-ring__num\" x=\"50\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">64</text>\n  </svg>\n  <div class=\"dd-score-ring__label\">On-Page</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Link form: the <a> owns the name, the svg is decorative -->\n<a class=\"dd-score-ring -bad -link\" href=\"#section-security\" aria-label=\"Security: 40 out of 100. View details\">\n  <svg class=\"dd-score-ring__svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <circle class=\"dd-score-ring__track\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" />\n    <circle class=\"dd-score-ring__value\" cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"263.9\" stroke-dashoffset=\"158.3\" transform=\"rotate(-90 50 50)\" />\n    <text class=\"dd-score-ring__num\" x=\"50\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">40</text>\n  </svg>\n  <div class=\"dd-score-ring__label\">Security</div>\n  <div class=\"dd-score-ring__sub\">View details</div>\n</a>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "Group multiple rings in a grid to compare scores side by side.\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_score_ring.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines the ring geometry, arc stroke, and typography,\nwith size and tone modifiers driven by design tokens. Key modifiers\ninclude:\n\n- *-sm*: Small size for dense layouts.\n- *-lg*: Large size for feature or hero placement.\n- *-good*: Success-toned arc for healthy scores.\n- *-warn*: Warning-toned arc for middling scores.\n- *-bad*: Error-toned arc for poor scores.\n- *-link*: Renders the anchor form so the whole gauge is\n  navigable.\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/scss/components/_dd_score_ring.scss (styles)\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nIn the figure form the SVG carries *role=\"img\"* and an\n*aria-label* stating the score and maximum. In the link form\nthe *&lt;a>* owns the accessible name and the SVG is marked\n*aria-hidden=\"true\"* to avoid a duplicate announcement. The\nvalue is always present as visible text, so meaning does not depend on\nthe arc or colour (WCAG 1.1.1 and 1.4.1). The arc grow-in animation is\ngated behind *prefers-reduced-motion*, and the link hit area is\nat least 24 by 24 CSS pixels (WCAG 2.5.8 Target Size Minimum)."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-section",
      "slug": "components/section",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Section Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Section Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-section component provides a foundational container for grouping content blocks on a page.",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-section-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-section-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Section Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-section component provides a foundational container for\ngrouping content blocks on a page. It handles layout constraints,\nbackground colors (with alternation), padding, and responsive widths,\nserving as a wrapper for other components like titles, grids, and\nitems.\n\nThis component is ideal for dividing pages into logical sections, such\nas intros, features, or footers. In WordPress, configure it via ACF\nflexible content or layouts for section types, with fields for\nfull/contained, title, and inner items. In Drupal, use a Paragraph\ntype as a section wrapper, nesting other paragraphs inside, with\noptions for modifiers.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nUse a section with class *dd-section* for contained width or\nadd *-full* for full-width. Include content with title and\nitems in a grid. Backgrounds alternate automatically via CSS."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<section class=\"dd-section -full-contained\">\n  <div class=\"dd-section__content\">\n    <div class=\"dd-section__title l-box\">Section \"contained\" with max width set</div>\n    <div class=\"dd-section__items dd-g\">\n      <div class=\"dd-section__item dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-8-24 l-box\">\n        <!-- component go here-->\n        Section Item goes here. This item can be any of the other components.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dd-section__item dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-8-24 l-box\">\n        <!-- component go here-->\n        Section Item goes here. This item can be any of the other components.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dd-section__item dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-8-24 l-box\">\n        <!-- component go here-->\n        Section Item goes here. This item can be any of the other components.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<section class=\"dd-section -full-contained\">\n  <div class=\"dd-section__content\">\n    <div class=\"dd-section__title l-box\">Section \"contained\" with max width set</div>\n    <div class=\"dd-section__items dd-g\">\n      <div class=\"dd-section__item dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-8-24 l-box\">\n        <!-- component go here-->\n        Section Item goes here. This item can be any of the other components.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dd-section__item dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-8-24 l-box\">\n        <!-- component go here-->\n        Section Item goes here. This item can be any of the other components.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dd-section__item dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-8-24 l-box\">\n        <!-- component go here-->\n        Section Item goes here. This item can be any of the other components.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "Nest other components inside __items for modular builds; use l-box for\npadding on items.\n\n## CSS Modifiers (from _dd_section.scss)\n\nThe SCSS file defines base styles for sections, including default\npadding, max-width, and alternating backgrounds via :nth-child. Key\nmodifiers include:\n\n- *-full*: Sets max-width to 100% for full-width sections\n  (apply to both section and __content).\n- *-contained*: Limits __content to a max-width (default\n  behavior; explicit for overrides).\n- *-no-padding*: Removes default padding for custom spacing.\n- Utility classes for alignment.  *-x-center -y-center*\n- SAL data attributes for custom animations.\n  *data-sal=\"slide-up\"*\n\n## Framework files\n\n- source/scss/components/_dd_section.scss (styles)\n\nFor ACF/Paragraphs integration, use conditional fields to apply\nmodifiers dynamically.\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nUse role=\"region\" and aria-labelledby for titled sections. Ensure\nbackgrounds provide sufficient contrast. Nest semantic elements\ninside. Test landmark navigation with screen readers. In CMS, make\ntitles optional but encouraged for labeled regions."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "page-components-slider",
      "slug": "components/slider",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Slider Component Breakdown",
        "meta_title": "Slider Component Breakdown | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The dd-slider component provides a responsive carousel for images and copy with previous and next buttons as wells and dot navigation.",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-components-slider-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-components-slider-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Slider Component Breakdown"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe dd-slider component provides a responsive carousel for images and copy with previous and next buttons as wells and dot navigation.\n\nThis component is ideal for when space is limited but there are several items to be displayed. Mostly used for images with possible copy block for descriptions or CTA functionality.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\nWrap slide items in a div with class *dd-slider*."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<div class=\"dd-slider\">\n  <div class=\"dd-slider__title\">\n    <h2>Slider title</h2>\n  </div>\n  <ul class=\"dd-slider__items -nostyle\">\n    <!-- start slide item -->\n    <li class=\"dd-slider__item\" data-id=\"uid_0001\">\n      <div class=\"dd-slider__content\">\n        <div class=\"dd-g\">\n          <!-- Start body -->\n          <div class=\"dd-slider__body dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24 l-box\">\n            <div class=\"dd-slider__title\">\n              Slide item title\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"dd-slider__copy\">\n              Slide item copy block\n              <div class=\"dd-slider__links\">\n                <div class=\"dd-slider__link\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">slider Link 1</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"dd-slider__link\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -ghost\">slider Link 2</a>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- End body -->\n          <!-- Start image or video -->\n          <div class=\"dd-slider__image dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\">\n            <img\n              src=\"https://dummyimage.com/600x400/000/fff\"\n              alt=\"slider alt tag for image\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          <!-- End image or video -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <!-- end slide item -->\n    <!-- start slide item -->\n    <li class=\"dd-slider__item\" data-id=\"uid_0001\">\n      <div class=\"dd-slider__content\">\n        <div class=\"dd-g\">\n          <!-- Start body -->\n          <div class=\"dd-slider__body dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24 l-box\">\n            <div class=\"dd-slider__title\">\n              Slide item title\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"dd-slider__copy\">\n              Slide item copy block\n              <div class=\"dd-slider__links\">\n                <div class=\"dd-slider__link\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">slider Link 1</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"dd-slider__link\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -ghost\">slider Link 2</a>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- End body -->\n          <!-- Start image or video -->\n          <div class=\"dd-slider__image dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\">\n            <img\n              src=\"https://dummyimage.com/600x400/000/fff\"\n              alt=\"slider alt tag for image\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          <!-- End image or video -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <!-- end slide item -->\n    <!-- start slide item -->\n    <li class=\"dd-slider__item\" data-id=\"uid_0001\">\n      <div class=\"dd-slider__content\">\n        <div class=\"dd-g\">\n          <!-- Start body -->\n          <div class=\"dd-slider__body dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24 l-box\">\n            <div class=\"dd-slider__title\">\n              Slide item title\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"dd-slider__copy\">\n              Slide item copy block\n              <div class=\"dd-slider__links\">\n                <div class=\"dd-slider__link\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">slider Link 1</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"dd-slider__link\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -ghost\">slider Link 2</a>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- End body -->\n          <!-- Start image or video -->\n          <div class=\"dd-slider__image dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\">\n            <img\n              src=\"https://dummyimage.com/600x400/000/fff\"\n              alt=\"slider alt tag for image\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          <!-- End image or video -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <!-- end slide item -->\n  </ul>\n  <div class=\"dd-slider__navigation\">\n    <button id=\"dd-slider__previous\" class=\"dd-slider__previous\"><span class=\"-scrn-reader-only\">Previous slide</span> < </button>\n    <ul class=\"dd-slider__tabs -nostyle\"></ul>\n    <button id=\"dd-slider__next\" class=\"dd-slider__next\"><span class=\"-scrn-reader-only\">Next slide</span> > </button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<div class=\"dd-slider\">\n  <div class=\"dd-slider__title\">\n    <h2>Slider title</h2>\n  </div>\n  <ul class=\"dd-slider__items -nostyle\">\n    <!-- start slide item -->\n    <li class=\"dd-slider__item\" data-id=\"uid_0001\">\n      <div class=\"dd-slider__content\">\n        <div class=\"dd-g\">\n          <!-- Start body -->\n          <div class=\"dd-slider__body dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24 l-box\">\n            <div class=\"dd-slider__title\">\n              Slide item title\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"dd-slider__copy\">\n              Slide item copy block\n              <div class=\"dd-slider__links\">\n                <div class=\"dd-slider__link\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">slider Link 1</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"dd-slider__link\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -ghost\">slider Link 2</a>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- End body -->\n          <!-- Start image or video -->\n          <div class=\"dd-slider__image dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\">\n            <img\n              src=\"https://dummyimage.com/600x400/000/fff\"\n              alt=\"slider alt tag for image\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          <!-- End image or video -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <!-- end slide item -->\n    <!-- start slide item -->\n    <li class=\"dd-slider__item\" data-id=\"uid_0001\">\n      <div class=\"dd-slider__content\">\n        <div class=\"dd-g\">\n          <!-- Start body -->\n          <div class=\"dd-slider__body dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24 l-box\">\n            <div class=\"dd-slider__title\">\n              Slide item title\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"dd-slider__copy\">\n              Slide item copy block\n              <div class=\"dd-slider__links\">\n                <div class=\"dd-slider__link\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">slider Link 1</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"dd-slider__link\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -ghost\">slider Link 2</a>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- End body -->\n          <!-- Start image or video -->\n          <div class=\"dd-slider__image dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\">\n            <img\n              src=\"https://dummyimage.com/600x400/000/fff\"\n              alt=\"slider alt tag for image\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          <!-- End image or video -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <!-- end slide item -->\n    <!-- start slide item -->\n    <li class=\"dd-slider__item\" data-id=\"uid_0001\">\n      <div class=\"dd-slider__content\">\n        <div class=\"dd-g\">\n          <!-- Start body -->\n          <div class=\"dd-slider__body dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24 l-box\">\n            <div class=\"dd-slider__title\">\n              Slide item title\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"dd-slider__copy\">\n              Slide item copy block\n              <div class=\"dd-slider__links\">\n                <div class=\"dd-slider__link\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -primary\">slider Link 1</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"dd-slider__link\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"dd-button -ghost\">slider Link 2</a>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- End body -->\n          <!-- Start image or video -->\n          <div class=\"dd-slider__image dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-12-24\">\n            <img\n              src=\"https://dummyimage.com/600x400/000/fff\"\n              alt=\"slider alt tag for image\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          <!-- End image or video -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </li>\n    <!-- end slide item -->\n  </ul>\n  <div class=\"dd-slider__navigation\">\n    <button id=\"dd-slider__previous\" class=\"dd-slider__previous\"><span class=\"-scrn-reader-only\">Previous slide</span> < </button>\n    <ul class=\"dd-slider__tabs -nostyle\"></ul>\n    <button id=\"dd-slider__next\" class=\"dd-slider__next\"><span class=\"-scrn-reader-only\">Next slide</span> > </button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Framework files\n\n- source/js/components/_dd_slider.js (styles)\n- source/scss/components/_dd_slider.scss (styles)\n\nFor ACF/Paragraphs integration, use conditional fields to apply\nmodifiers dynamically.\n\n## Accessibility and Best Practices\n\nEnsure\nbackgrounds provide sufficient contrast. Nest semantic elements\ninside. Test landmark navigation with screen readers. In CMS, make\ntitles optional but encouraged."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
