                  "parent_copy": "# Footer medium"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThis footer variant supports multi-level navigation menus, company info (including logo, address, phone, and email), social media links, and a copyright section."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<footer class=\"dd-footer\">\n  <div class=\"dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-footer__navigation navigation -footer-menu dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-18-24 l-box\">\n      <nav class=\"navigation\" role=\"navigation\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" aria-label=\"Footer navigation\">\n        <ul class=\"menu\">\n          <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link\">First Menu</a></li>\n          <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link\">Second Menu</a></li>\n          <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link\">Third Menu</a></li>\n          <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link\">Fourth Menu</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-footer__company-info dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-16-24 l-box\">\n      <div class=\"dd-g\">\n        <div class=\"dd-footer__logo dd-u-6-24\">\n          <img class=\"dd-img\" src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC.\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-footer__name dd-u-18-24 l-box\">{{ Name Of Company }}</div>\n        <div class=\"dd-footer__contact dd-u-1-1 l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-footer__address dd-u-1-1\">\n            <address>{{ Company Address }}</address>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-footer__phone dd-u-1-1\">\n            <a href=\"tel:555-555-5555\" title=\"Call 555-555-5555\">555-555-5555</a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-footer__email dd-u-1-1\">\n            <a href=\"mailto:info@company.com\" title=\"Send email to info@company.com\">info@company.com</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dd-footer__navigation navigation -social-menu dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-8-24 l-box\">\n      <nav class=\"navigation\" role=\"navigation\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" aria-label=\"Footer navigation\">\n        <ul class=\"menu\">\n          <li class=\"menu-item\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/AnchorBrewing\" itemprop=\"url\" class=\"-facebook\"><span class=\"visually-hidden\">Facebook</span></a>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"menu-item\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/anchorbrewing/\" itemprop=\"url\" class=\"-instagram\"><span class=\"visually-hidden\">Instagram</span></a>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"menu-item\">\n            <a href=\"https://twitter.com/AnchorBrewing\" itemprop=\"url\" class=\"-x\"><span class=\"visually-hidden\">Twitter</span></a>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-footer__copyright dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"l-box\">\n        {{ copyright goes here }}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<footer class=\"dd-footer\">\n  <div class=\"dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-footer__navigation navigation -footer-menu dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-18-24 l-box\">\n      <nav class=\"navigation\" role=\"navigation\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" aria-label=\"Footer navigation\">\n        <ul class=\"menu\">\n          <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link\">First Menu</a></li>\n          <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link\">Second Menu</a></li>\n          <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link\">Third Menu</a></li>\n          <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link\">Fourth Menu</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-footer__company-info dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-16-24 l-box\">\n      <div class=\"dd-g\">\n        <div class=\"dd-footer__logo dd-u-6-24\">\n          <img class=\"dd-img\" src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-box-solid.svg\" alt=\"ldnddev, LLC.\" />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"dd-footer__name dd-u-18-24 l-box\">{{ Name Of Company }}</div>\n        <div class=\"dd-footer__contact dd-u-1-1 l-box\">\n          <div class=\"dd-footer__address dd-u-1-1\">\n            <address>{{ Company Address }}</address>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-footer__phone dd-u-1-1\">\n            <a href=\"tel:555-555-5555\" title=\"Call 555-555-5555\">555-555-5555</a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"dd-footer__email dd-u-1-1\">\n            <a href=\"mailto:info@company.com\" title=\"Send email to info@company.com\">info@company.com</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dd-footer__navigation navigation -social-menu dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-8-24 l-box\">\n      <nav class=\"navigation\" role=\"navigation\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" aria-label=\"Footer navigation\">\n        <ul class=\"menu\">\n          <li class=\"menu-item\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/AnchorBrewing\" itemprop=\"url\" class=\"-facebook\"><span class=\"visually-hidden\">Facebook</span></a>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"menu-item\">\n            <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/anchorbrewing/\" itemprop=\"url\" class=\"-instagram\"><span class=\"visually-hidden\">Instagram</span></a>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"menu-item\">\n            <a href=\"https://twitter.com/AnchorBrewing\" itemprop=\"url\" class=\"-x\"><span class=\"visually-hidden\">Twitter</span></a>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dd-g\">\n    <div class=\"dd-footer__copyright dd-u-1-1\">\n      <div class=\"l-box\">\n        {{ copyright goes here }}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n```"
