                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<footer class=\"dd-footer dd-footer-001\">\n  <div class=\"dd-footer__intro-contact dd-g l-box\">\n    <div class=\"dd-footer__intro-menu dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-16-24 l-box\">\n      <div class=\"dd-footer__intro-menu-content dd-g\">\n        <div class=\"dd-footer__intro-menu-title h1 dd-u-1-1\">Some Interesting links for you to check out</div>\n        <div class=\"dd-footer__intro-menu-menu dd-u-1-1\">\n          <div class=\"dd-g\">\n            <div class=\"dd-footer__navigation navigation -footer-menu dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-8-24\">\n              <nav class=\"navigation -footer\" role=\"navigation\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" aria-label=\"Footer navigation first\">\n                <ul class=\"menu\">\n                  <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link -no-link\">First Menu</a>\n                    <ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n                      <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link\">Menu Item</a></li>\n                      <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link\">Menu Item</a></li>\n                      <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link\">Menu Item</a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                  </li>\n                </ul>\n              </nav>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"dd-footer__navigation navigation -footer-menu dd-u-1-1 dd-u-lg-8-24\">\n              <nav class=\"navigation -footer\" role=\"navigation\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" aria-label=\"Footer navigation second\">\n                <ul class=\"menu\">\n                  <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link -no-link\">Second Menu</a>\n                    <ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n                      <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link\">Menu Item</a></li>\n                      <li class=\"menu-item\"><a href=