                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<header class=\"dd-header\">\n  <div class=\"dd-alert -compact\">\n    <div class=\"dd-g\">\n      <div class=\"dd-u-1-1\">\n        <div class=\"dd-alert__copy l-box\">ipsum banner copy goes here</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dd-header__top\">\n    <div class=\"dd-g -y-center\">\n      <div class=\"dd-header__logo dd-u-18-24 dd-u-sm-18-24 dd-u-md-18-24 dd-u-lg-2-24\">\n        <a href=\"#\" hx-get=\"/pages/home.html\" hx-target=\"main\" hx-swap=\"innterHTML\">\n          <picture>\n            <source srcset=\"/assets/imgs/logo-full-white-text.svg\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/imgs/logo-full-black-text.svg\" alt=\"logo\" class=\"dd-img\">\n          </picture>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dd-header__navigation navigation -main-menu dd-u-1-1 dd-u-sm-1-1 dd-u-md-1-1 dd-u-lg-18-24 -y-center\">\n        <nav itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\" aria-label=\"header navigation\">\n          <button class=\"dd-menu__close\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\" fill=\"none\"></path><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M11.9997 10.5865L16.9495 5.63672L18.3637 7.05093L13.4139 12.0007L18.3637 16.9504L16.9495 18.3646L11.9997 13.4149L7.04996 18.3646L5.63574 16.9504L10.5855 12.0007L5.63574 7.05093L7.04996 5.63672L11.9997 10.5865Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"visually-hidden\">Menu</span></button>\n          <ul class=\"menu\">\n            <li class=\"menu-item menu-item-has-children\">\n              <a href=\"#\">First Menu</a>\n              <ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link\">Link</a>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"navigation__link\">Link<