      "id": "page-elements-forms",
      "slug": "elements/forms",
      "slug_locked": false,
      "head": {
        "title": "Forms",
        "meta_title": "Forms | ldnddev Framework",
        "meta_description": "The following shows all form elements with their default styles.",
        "canonical_url": null,
        "robots": "index, follow",
        "schema_type": "WebPage",
        "og_title": null,
        "og_description": null,
        "og_image": null
      },
      "nodes": [
        {
          "node_type": "section",
          "id": "page-elements-forms-section-1",
          "section_title": null,
          "section_class": "-full-lg",
          "item_box_class": "l-box",
          "sal": "no-animation",
          "columns": [
            {
              "id": "page-elements-forms-section-1-column-1",
              "width_class": "dd-u-1-1",
              "components": [
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "# Forms"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Overview\n\nThe following shows all form elements with their default styles."
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Preview"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "<div class=\"dd-example\">\n<label for=\"input__text\">Form text</label>\n<input id=\"input__text\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"text\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__password\">Form password</label>\n<input id=\"input__password\" type=\"password\" placeholder=\"password\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__email\">Form email</label>\n<input id=\"input__email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"email\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__url\">Form url</label>\n<input id=\"input__url\" type=\"url\" placeholder=\"url\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__date\">Form date</label>\n<input id=\"input__date\" type=\"date\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__month\">Form month</label>\n<input id=\"input__month\" type=\"month\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__time\">Form time</label>\n<input id=\"input__time\" type=\"time\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__datetime-local\">Form datetime-local</label>\n<input id=\"input__datetime-local\" type=\"datetime-local\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__week\">Form week</label>\n<input id=\"input__week\" type=\"week\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__number\">Form number</label>\n<input id=\"input__number\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__tel\">Form tel</label>\n<input\n  id=\"input__tel\"\n  type=\"tel\"\n  pattern=\"[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{4}\"\n  minlength=\"9\"\n  maxlength=\"14\"\n  placeholder=\"555-555-5555\"\n/>\n<p>Other examples:</p>\n<input\n  id=\"input__tel--areacode\"\n  type=\"tel\"\n  pattern=\"[0-9]{3}\"\n  minlength=\"3\"\n  maxlength=\"3\"\n  placeholder=\"555\"\n/>\n-\n<input\n  id=\"input__tel--first\"\n  type=\"tel\"\n  pattern=\"[0-9]{3}\"\n  minlength=\"3\"\n  maxlength=\"3\"\n  placeholder=\"555\"\n/>\n-\n<input\n  id=\"input__tel--second\"\n  type=\"tel\"\n  pattern=\"[0-9]{4}\"\n  minlength=\"4\"\n  maxlength=\"4\"\n  placeholder=\"5555\"\n/>\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__file\">Form file</label>\n<input id=\"input__file\" type=\"file\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__disabled\">Input Disabled</label>\n<input id=\"input__disabled\" type=\"text\" value=\"Disabled\" disabled />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__readonly\">Input Readonly</label>\n<input id=\"input__readonly\" type=\"text\" value=\"Read Only\" readonly />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__radio\">Form radio</label>\n<input id=\"input__radio\" type=\"radio\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__checkbox\">Form checkbox</label>\n<input id=\"input__checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__color\">Form color</label>\n<input id=\"input__color\" type=\"color\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__button\">Form button</label>\n<input id=\"input__button\" type=\"button\" value=\"Button\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__submit\">Form submit</label>\n<input id=\"input__submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Submit\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n<label for=\"input__reset\">Form reset</label>\n<input id=\"input__reset\" type=\"reset\" value=\"Reset\" />\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n</div>"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "### Code"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "```html\n<label for=\"input__text\">Form text</label>\n<input id=\"input__text\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"text\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__password\">Form password</label>\n<input id=\"input__password\" type=\"password\" placeholder=\"password\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__email\">Form email</label>\n<input id=\"input__email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"email\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__url\">Form url</label>\n<input id=\"input__url\" type=\"url\" placeholder=\"url\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__date\">Form date</label>\n<input id=\"input__date\" type=\"date\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__month\">Form month</label>\n<input id=\"input__month\" type=\"month\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__time\">Form time</label>\n<input id=\"input__time\" type=\"time\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__datetime-local\">Form datetime-local</label>\n<input id=\"input__datetime-local\" type=\"datetime-local\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__week\">Form week</label>\n<input id=\"input__week\" type=\"week\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__number\">Form number</label>\n<input id=\"input__number\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__tel\">Form tel</label>\n<input\n  id=\"input__tel\"\n  type=\"tel\"\n  pattern=\"[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{4}\"\n  minlength=\"9\"\n  maxlength=\"14\"\n  placeholder=\"555-555-5555\"\n/>\n<p>Other examples:</p>\n<input\n  id=\"input__tel--areacode\"\n  type=\"tel\"\n  pattern=\"[0-9]{3}\"\n  minlength=\"3\"\n  maxlength=\"3\"\n  placeholder=\"555\"\n/>\n-\n<input\n  id=\"input__tel--first\"\n  type=\"tel\"\n  pattern=\"[0-9]{3}\"\n  minlength=\"3\"\n  maxlength=\"3\"\n  placeholder=\"555\"\n/>\n-\n<input\n  id=\"input__tel--second\"\n  type=\"tel\"\n  pattern=\"[0-9]{4}\"\n  minlength=\"4\"\n  maxlength=\"4\"\n  placeholder=\"5555\"\n/>\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__file\">Form file</label>\n<input id=\"input__file\" type=\"file\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__disabled\">Input Disabled</label>\n<input id=\"input__disabled\" type=\"text\" value=\"Disabled\" disabled />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__readonly\">Input Readonly</label>\n<input id=\"input__readonly\" type=\"text\" value=\"Read Only\" readonly />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__radio\">Form radio</label>\n<input id=\"input__radio\" type=\"radio\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__checkbox\">Form checkbox</label>\n<input id=\"input__checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__color\">Form color</label>\n<input id=\"input__color\" type=\"color\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__button\">Form button</label>\n<input id=\"input__button\" type=\"button\" value=\"Button\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__submit\">Form submit</label>\n<input id=\"input__submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Submit\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n\n<label for=\"input__reset\">Form reset</label>\n<input id=\"input__reset\" type=\"reset\" value=\"Reset\" />\n\n<div class=\"dd-spacer -xxl -divider\"></div>\n```"
                },
                {
                  "component_type": "rich_text",
                  "parent_class": null,
                  "sal": "no-animation",
                  "parent_copy": "## Framework files\n\n- source/scss/elements/_forms.scss (styles)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
